Acceptance checklist
• Level 1 still works exactly as before.
• The sword draws with R and slashes with click or J, with clear feedback, and can't be used while flat or dashing.
• The player has 3 hits, takes knockback, gets 1 s of invulnerability, and dying resets the room and the bat.
• The bat's alert, dive, stun and return are clearly readable, the dive target is locked after the alert, one hit kills it, and it ignores the player while flat under the pillar.
• 2A can't be finished without pressing S1 then S2, and S2 visibly folds both the wall and the stairs.
• 2B can only be passed by sliding through the slit, and the seal can only be removed with the sword.
• 2C needs the fans' timing, the pit never traps the player, and the bat's dive bends in the draught.
• Both crease choices work, no crease is required to finish, and the choice screen appears after Level 1.
• Backspace resets any room instantly, and Level 2 rooms appear in Room select in both menus.
• No console errors and no external assets.
